  "interpretation": "The frozen known-truth design did not show robust thresholding amplification. Under a first-order latent ecological process, converting the same Binomial point sample from quantitative frequency to binary detection was not sufficient to create the Tampa-like older-history advantage. This weakens a coarse-graining-only explanation for the field contrast.",
